{"seq":3,"slug":"reship-intransit-proof-delivery","title":"补发在途追踪与签收证明（联076）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/exchange-reship-fulfillment/reship-cost-customs/reship-intransit-proof-delivery","wordCount":2359,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"补发在途追踪与签收证明-联076\">补发在途追踪与签收证明（联076）</h1><p>补发的交付证据有双重用途：对内它决定这一单是否算完成，对外它决定当买家再次声称未收到时卖家能不能站住。这两件事对证据的形状要求不同——内部完成判定只需要一个「已送达」事件，而对外抗辩需要一条能被第三方理解的证据链。把这两者混成一个布尔字段（<code>is_delivered</code>），会让系统在争议阶段拿不出可用材料。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-交付证据要满足三个使用场景\">核心概念：交付证据要满足三个使用场景</h2><p>一份有效的交付证据要同时满足三个场景，这三个场景对证据的要求层层递进。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>使用场景</th>\n<th>需要证明什么</th>\n<th>关键字段</th>\n<th>可接受的证据形态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内部完成判定</td>\n<td>这一单可以关单</td>\n<td>送达事件 + 时间</td>\n<td>承运人状态事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>承运人索赔</td>\n<td>损失发生在承运人责任期</td>\n<td>揽收、中转、派送全链序列</td>\n<td>轨迹全量快照</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支付争议抗辩</td>\n<td>货已送达该买家地址</td>\n<td>收件地址、签收人、签收时间、轨迹</td>\n<td>可下载的证据文件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"争议场景的证据不能被链接替代\">争议场景的证据不能被链接替代</h3><p>最容易被低估的是第三行。卡组织的争议流程对证据有一个硬限制：<strong>受理银行不会查看任何外部内容</strong>——不接受音视频、不接受「请联系我们了解详情」的请求、不接受需要点击才能查看的链接（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/disputes/responding\">Stripe 争议应答</a>）。这意味着「我们的轨迹链接在这里」不是一个有效的抗辩材料。证据必须是自包含的、在上传时就完整呈现的文档。</p>\n<p>另一个硬限制是提交机会只有一次，且提交后不能修改或补充。这决定了证据必须<strong>在补发流程中被持续采集</strong>，而不是在争议发生时临时拼凑——因为争议通知到达时，往往已经过了承运人提供完整轨迹的窗口。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[补发件发出] --&gt; B[揽收事件&lt;br/&gt;ACCEPTED]&#10;  B --&gt; C[出境/中转事件&lt;br/&gt;IN_TRANSIT]&#10;  C --&gt; D[到达目的地&lt;br/&gt;ARRIVED]&#10;  D --&gt; E{派送结果}&#10;  E --&gt;|成功| F[DELIVERED&lt;br/&gt;含签收人/时间]&#10;  E --&gt;|失败| G[ATTEMPT_FAILED]&#10;  E --&gt;|超时无更新| H[STALE&lt;br/&gt;触发丢件查询]&#10;  F --&gt; I[归档交付证据包]&#10;  G --&gt; J[重派或转自提点]&#10;  J --&gt; E&#10;  H --&gt; K[向承运人发起查询]&#10;  K --&gt;|确认丢失| L[LOST 确认]&#10;  K --&gt;|找到| C\">graph TD\n  A[补发件发出] --&gt; B[揽收事件&lt;br/&gt;ACCEPTED]\n  B --&gt; C[出境/中转事件&lt;br/&gt;IN_TRANSIT]\n  C --&gt; D[到达目的地&lt;br/&gt;ARRIVED]\n  D --&gt; E{派送结果}\n  E --&gt;|成功| F[DELIVERED&lt;br/&gt;含签收人/时间]\n  E --&gt;|失败| G[ATTEMPT_FAILED]\n  E --&gt;|超时无更新| H[STALE&lt;br/&gt;触发丢件查询]\n  F --&gt; I[归档交付证据包]\n  G --&gt; J[重派或转自提点]\n  J --&gt; E\n  H --&gt; K[向承运人发起查询]\n  K --&gt;|确认丢失| L[LOST 确认]\n  K --&gt;|找到| C</pre><h2 id=\"证据包的对象模型\">证据包的对象模型</h2><h3 id=\"证据包的三个一致性约束\">证据包的三个一致性约束</h3><p>证据包需要用一张表承载，并且要有明确的<strong>采集时点</strong>，因为它不是补发单的一个属性，而是一个随时间增长的序列。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE delivery_evidence (&#10;  evidence_id    BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  request_id     BIGINT      NOT NULL REFERENCES reship_request(request_id),&#10;  shipment_id    BIGINT      NOT NULL REFERENCES shipment(shipment_id),&#10;&#10;  evidence_type  TEXT        NOT NULL&#10;                 CHECK (evidence_type IN (&#39;TRACKING_SNAPSHOT&#39;,&#39;POD_IMAGE&#39;,&#10;                                          &#39;SIGNATURE&#39;,&#39;WEIGHT_RECORD&#39;,&#10;                                          &#39;ADDRESS_CONFIRM&#39;,&#39;CARRIER_LETTER&#39;)),&#10;  captured_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  source         TEXT        NOT NULL&#10;                 CHECK (source IN (&#39;CARRIER_API&#39;,&#39;WAREHOUSE&#39;,&#39;BUYER&#39;,&#39;CARRIER_MANUAL&#39;)),&#10;&#10;  recipient_name TEXT,&#10;  recipient_rel  TEXT        CHECK (recipient_rel IN&#10;                   (&#39;ADDRESSEE&#39;,&#39;HOUSEHOLD&#39;,&#39;NEIGHBOR&#39;,&#39;PICKUP_POINT&#39;,&#39;FRONT_DESK&#39;)),&#10;  signed_at      TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;&#10;  storage_ref    TEXT,&#10;  content_hash   TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  created_at     TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;&#10;  CONSTRAINT pod_needs_storage CHECK (&#10;    evidence_type NOT IN (&#39;POD_IMAGE&#39;,&#39;CARRIER_LETTER&#39;) OR storage_ref IS NOT NULL&#10;  ),&#10;  CONSTRAINT signed_needs_time CHECK (&#10;    (recipient_name IS NULL AND signed_at IS NULL)&#10;    OR (recipient_name IS NOT NULL AND signed_at IS NOT NULL)&#10;  )&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> delivery_evidence</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  evidence_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  request_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reship_request(request_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  shipment_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shipment(shipment_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  evidence_type  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                 CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (evidence_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'TRACKING_SNAPSHOT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'POD_IMAGE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                                          'SIGNATURE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'WEIGHT_RECORD'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                                          'ADDRESS_CONFIRM'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CARRIER_LETTER'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  captured_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                 CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (source </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CARRIER_API'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'WAREHOUSE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'BUYER'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CARRIER_MANUAL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  recipient_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  recipient_rel  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (recipient_rel </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                   (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ADDRESSEE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'HOUSEHOLD'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'NEIGHBOR'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PICKUP_POINT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'FRONT_DESK'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  signed_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  storage_ref    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  content_hash   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pod_needs_storage </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    evidence_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'POD_IMAGE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CARRIER_LETTER'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> storage_ref </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> signed_needs_time </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (recipient_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> signed_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    OR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (recipient_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> signed_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个设计点。<code>recipient_rel</code>（签收人与收件人的关系）是关键字段：跨境场景下签收人常常不是买家本人——可能是家人、邻居、前台、自提点。这个字段既用于内部判断「这个签收是否算送达」，也用于争议抗辩时的说服力评估。把它做成受控词表而不是自由文本，才能被统计与规则化。</p>\n<p><code>content_hash</code> 用于证明证据未被篡改，这在客诉升级为争议或法律程序时是必要的。但注意它<strong>不作为默认的隐私控制手段</strong>——哈希只能证明一致性，不能替代访问控制。证据包的访问控制与留存期限属于隐私设计范畴，应遵循最小化原则：只保留证明交付所需的最小集合，而不是把买家所有交互数据都塞进去。</p>\n<p><code>pod_needs_storage</code> 与 <code>signed_needs_time</code> 把两组一致性要求固化：影像类证据必须有存储引用（防止只有元数据没有实物），签收人与签收时间必须同时存在或同时缺失（防止出现「有签收人但不知道何时」这种半截证据）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"签收证明的价值与局限\">签收证明的价值与局限</h2><p>签收证明（Proof of Delivery，简称 POD）是争议抗辩中最强的单件证据。Stripe 的争议预防建议中明确提到对高价值商品要求签收，以应对「包裹丢失」和「友好欺诈」两类情形（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/disputes/monitoring-programs\">Stripe 争议预防建议</a>）。但它的作用有明确边界：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>无签收</th>\n<th>有本人签收</th>\n<th>有他人代收</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>买家声称未收到</td>\n<td>抗辩弱</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>中等（需说明代收关系）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>买家声称少件</td>\n<td>无帮助</td>\n<td>无帮助</td>\n<td>无帮助</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>买家声称错发</td>\n<td>无帮助</td>\n<td>无帮助</td>\n<td>无帮助</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>承运人索赔</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第二、三行是这张表最重要的信息。<strong>签收证明只能证明「有个包裹到了」，不能证明「包裹里有什么」</strong>。因此它只对「未收到」类主张有效，对「少件」「错发」类主张毫无帮助。后者的抗辩材料是出库证据（装箱记录、出库重量、拣货扫描），与签收完全无关——这也解释了为什么第 2 章第 1 篇把出库重量列为最被低估的证据。</p>\n<p>由此得到一个直接的设计结论：<strong>证据采集必须是多类型的</strong>。只采集签收证明的系统，会在「少件」类争议中每次都败诉，而这类争议的金额通常不高、数量却很多，累积损失可观。</p>\n<h2 id=\"轨迹新鲜度的监控\">轨迹新鲜度的监控</h2><p>在途追踪的另一个用途是及时发现「轨迹停止更新」。这个信号是丢件判定（第 2 章）的输入，也是客服主动触达的触发条件。</p>\n<p>设某补发件的承诺时效为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>promise</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{promise}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">promise</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（从发出到送达的天数），最后一次轨迹更新距今为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>stale</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{stale}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">stale</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。一个可用的预警规则是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>alert</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>WATCH</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>stale</mtext></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>promise</mtext></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>QUERY</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>stale</mtext></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>promise</mtext></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>LIKELY_LOST</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>stale</mtext></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>promise</mtext></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{alert} = \\begin{cases} \\text{WATCH} &amp; t_{\\text{stale}} &gt; 0.5\\, t_{\\text{promise}} \\\\ \\text{QUERY} &amp; t_{\\text{stale}} &gt; t_{\\text{promise}} \\\\ \\text{LIKELY\\_LOST} &amp; t_{\\text{stale}} &gt; 1.5\\, t_{\\text{promise}} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">alert</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.32em;vertical-align:-1.91em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.192em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">WATCH</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">QUERY</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LIKELY_LOST</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">stale</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">promise</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">stale</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">promise</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">stale</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">promise</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"为什么阈值用承诺时效的比例\">为什么阈值用承诺时效的比例</h3><p>分三档而不是一档的原因是要区分「主动查询」与「宣布丢失」两种动作的成本：向承运人发起查询是免费的，而宣布丢失会触发补发或退款的成本。用三档可以让系统在还没有确认丢失时就先发起查询，把等待时间用在获取信息上。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH last_scan AS (&#10;  SELECT s.shipment_id,&#10;         max(e.event_at) AS last_event_at,&#10;         s.promise_days,&#10;         s.shipped_at + make_interval(days =&gt; s.promise_days) AS due_at&#10;  FROM   shipment s&#10;  LEFT JOIN shipment_scan_event e ON e.shipment_id = s.shipment_id&#10;  WHERE  s.kind = &#39;RESHIP&#39; AND s.state NOT IN (&#39;DELIVERED&#39;,&#39;CANCELLED&#39;)&#10;  GROUP  BY s.shipment_id, s.promise_days, s.shipped_at&#10;)&#10;SELECT shipment_id,&#10;       last_event_at,&#10;       due_at,&#10;       now() - due_at AS overdue,&#10;       CASE&#10;         WHEN now() &gt; due_at + make_interval(days =&gt; (promise_days / 2)::int)&#10;           THEN &#39;LIKELY_LOST&#39;&#10;         WHEN now() &gt; due_at THEN &#39;QUERY&#39;&#10;         WHEN now() &gt; (due_at - make_interval(days =&gt; (promise_days / 2)::int))&#10;           THEN &#39;WATCH&#39;&#10;         ELSE &#39;ON_TIME&#39;&#10;       END AS stale_bucket&#10;FROM   last_scan&#10;WHERE  last_event_at IS NULL&#10;   OR  now() &gt; (due_at - make_interval(days =&gt; (promise_days / 2)::int))&#10;ORDER BY overdue DESC NULLS FIRST;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> last_scan </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">shipment_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">event_at</